🎵，专注于挖掘生活中的温暖旋律与甜蜜记忆。无论是清晨的鸟鸣、雨天的屋檐声，还是街角咖啡馆的慵懒氛围☕️，我都能从中捕捉灵感，将平凡瞬间转化为治愈人心的音乐作品🎧。\n\n擅长从日常点滴中提炼情感内核，运用编曲技巧赋予每段旋律独特生命力。无论是轻柔的钢琴曲🎹、温暖的民谣吉他🎸，还是复古的爵士乐🎷，都能在我的整理下焕发生机，让音乐成为情感的治愈载体。\n\n相信音乐是连接心灵的桥梁，常以咖啡香气为伴🌙，于氤氲中寻找音乐节奏。通过精心编排的音乐内容，希望为更多人传递心灵温暖，让生活中的小美好被温柔记录，成为岁月里可触摸的慰藉🌟。", "isMine": true, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260208/6faea7e56bb6ca15d61672fc71fc1816cbd1b3adf91340f2a4d9af66598c8c36.png", "memberStatus": true, "memberExpireDate": "2026/03/08", "circleMemberId": "2018867915568107521", "applyTime": null, "isOwner": true}], "isCircleExist": true, "checkInStatus": 2, "backgroundUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/background/circle/default.png", "hasActivity": false}], "total": 25, "nextStartId": null}, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Sun, 08 Feb 2026 21:10:18 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "v-1111769-1770585018524-2037", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "14132"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
